{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670910435231303987","title":"SOC设计工程师","description":"1、参与SOC系统的设计、分析和开发工作；\n2、参与SOC顶层或子模块的设计工作，根据需求制定各模块的设计规格和详细设计方案；\n3、完成RTL代码以及质量检查（lint,CDC，预综合等）预综合并输出timingspec；\n4、结合产品实际需求，在chiplet片间互联、处理器微架构等前沿技术领域进行探索和分析；\n5、跟踪和研究各个领域的技术进展及业界新技术。","requirement":"1、微电子、集成电路、电子信息、通信工程、计算机等相关专业；\n2、符合如下任一条件：\na.掌握Verilog语言并具备一定的coding能力，一定程度上掌握SOC的设计流程，并熟悉Synopsys/Cadence/Mentor等公司的EDA工具优先；\nb.了解芯片设计基本知识，如代码规范、工作环境和工具、典型电路(异步、状态机、FIFO、时钟复位、memory、缓存管理等)优先；\nc.熟悉CHI.AXI/AHB/APB等AMBA或其它总线协议优先；\n3、积极主动，认真严谨，有良好的沟通能力和团队合作能力。","city_info":{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","i18n_name":"西安"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786023167659,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7670910435231123763","city_list":[{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"西安","py_name":"xian","mdm_code":"MDCY00000395","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_ma